flowchart LR
    A[InitializePools] --> B[Create 2D AudioSources]
    A --> C[Create 3D AudioSources]

    D[Request Source] --> E{Pool Available?}
    E -- Yes --> F[Reuse AudioSource]
    E -- No --> G{Below Max Pool?}
    G -- Yes --> H[Create New Source]
    G -- No --> I[Steal Oldest Active Source]

    J[Audio Finished] --> K[ReturnToPool]
    K --> L[Disable Source]
    L --> M[Enqueue Back to Pool]
